758
01:23:09,985 --> 01:23:12,237
I don't think you understand.
This dude is bad.

759
01:23:12,404 --> 01:23:14,448
He had 20 guys around him...
I was there.

760
01:23:14,615 --> 01:23:17,284
- He's got shit he throws...
- He's got the sword and shit.

761
01:23:17,451 --> 01:23:20,913
Yeah, he can throw it in the air,
catch it underneath. Shut the fuck up!

762
01:23:21,079 --> 01:23:23,332
MAN [ON RADIO]: <i>There's no
entrance or exits where we are.</i>

763
01:23:23,499 --> 01:23:25,584
Make it happen, all right?
It's one guy on foot.

764
01:23:29,254 --> 01:23:30,923
Get him! Get him! Go!

765
01:23:31,089 --> 01:23:32,424
That's him, get him!

766
01:23:51,777 --> 01:23:54,446
Why am I hearing gunfire? Huh?

767
01:23:54,613 --> 01:23:57,658
Did I tell anybody to start shooting?
I need him alive.

768
01:23:58,408 --> 01:24:00,160
MAN 1:
No.

769
01:24:02,037 --> 01:24:04,957
Please. I just work for them.

770
01:24:07,501 --> 01:24:10,170
- Jesus Christ. Lock this place down.
MAN 2: Yes, sir.

771
01:24:47,165 --> 01:24:50,627
