Karen.

867
01:34:23,700 --> 01:34:25,535
Karen.

868
01:34:25,702 --> 01:34:27,078
Karen!

869
01:34:28,371 --> 01:34:30,832
Karen!

870
01:34:31,499 --> 01:34:32,625
Karen!

871
