01:42:29,894 --> 01:42:31,729
Stop.

927
01:42:34,190 --> 01:42:35,274
Oh, God.

928
01:42:36,609 --> 01:42:38,694
Don't stop.

929
01:42:52,291 --> 01:42:54,543
Don't stop.

930
