MERCURY: Deacon?
FROST: Not anymore.

944
01:46:54,241 --> 01:46:56,785
Frost.

945
01:46:56,952 --> 01:46:59,663
FROST: Kill him.
- Wait. I owe you, man.

946
01:46:59,830 --> 01:47:01,373
