Let's get out of here.

964
01:53:39,354 --> 01:53:43,442
I need to get back to the lab
if I'm gonna cure you.

965
01:53:44,359 --> 01:53:46,320
It's not over.

966
01:53:46,486 --> 01:53:48,613
You keep your cure.

967
01:53:48,947 --> 01:53:53,493
There's still a war going on,
and I have a job to do.

968
01:53:54,036 --> 01:53:58,665
You wanna help?
Make me a better serum.

969
01:54:35,786 --> 01:54:37,371
WOMAN [IN RUSSIAN]:

970
01:54:38,497 --> 01:54:39,790
MAN [IN RUSSIAN]:

971
01:54:50,842 --> 01:54:53,095
[MAN GRUNTS AND GROWLS]

972
01:54:53,261 --> 01:54:55,639
[SPEAKING IN RUSSIAN]

973
01:54:57,182 --> 01:54:59,059
[BLADE SPEAKS IN RUSSIAN]

974
01:55:02,270 --> 01:55:03,522
[IN RUSSIAN]

975
